<title>FRANCE: SBC Warburg cuts Castorama recommendation.</title>
<headline>SBC Warburg cuts Castorama recommendation.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokerage SBC Warburg lowered its recommendation on do-it-yourself hardware specialist Castorama to 'hold' from 'buy', fund managers said on Friday.</p>
<p>One fund manager said the downgrade was due to the broker's concern about whether the group had an effective international expansion strategy.</p>
<p>Castorama shares were 2.74 percent lower at 889 francs in trading volume of 31,000 shares at 0955 GMT. The blue-chip index CAC 40 was down 0.16 percent at the same time.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom 33+1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
